"reserve": {
"what": "Set aside, not placed (the owner, 22 November: \"keep that in reserve/hidden for now; we will want that welder to appear during the final rocket quest/ending as we prep the rocket\"): Valve's welder at work on the rocket, standing on the grate ring of level A beside it: the citizen (npc_citizen cit_welder_01a1, male_01) held in his welding loop by a scripted_sequence (ss_cit_welder_01a1, welder_loop), his sparks (env_spark spark_welding_2) and blue glow (env_sprite sprite_welding_2), both put on his left hand by a logic_auto (SetParent, SetParentAttachment anim_attachment_lh), a logic_timer (timer_spark_welding_01, every 1.5 to 3 s: sparks, glow and the weld sound on and off; StartDisabled, Valve's lift enabled it), its stop relay and the weld loop (ep2_outland_11.weld_loop, an Episode Two sound script: untested in Garry's Mod).",
